{"ref":"BDB, רַ֫עַשׁ","hw":"רַ֫עַשׁ","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">רַ֫עַשׁ</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 10:22\" href=\"/Jeremiah.10.22\">Je 10:22</a></sup> <strong>quaking, shaking</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"I Kings 19:11\" href=\"/I_Kings.19.11\">1 K 19:11</a> +, cstr. <a data-ref=\"Nahum 3:2\" href=\"/Nahum.3.2\">Na 3:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 41:21\" href=\"/Job.41.21\">Jb 41:21</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  specif. <em>earthquake</em>, <a data-ref=\"Amos 1:1\" href=\"/Amos.1.1\">Am 1:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 14:5\" href=\"/Zechariah.14.5\">Zc 14:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 19:11\" href=\"/I_Kings.19.11\">1 K 19:11</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 19:12\" href=\"/I_Kings.19.12\">12</a>; fig. of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>’s judgment <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 29:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.29.6\">Is 29:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 38:19\" href=\"/Ezekiel.38.19\">Ez 38:19</a>; cf. (in vision) <span dir=\"rtl\">קוֹל ר׳ גָּדוֹל</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 3:12\" href=\"/Ezekiel.3.12\">3:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 3:13\" href=\"/Ezekiel.3.13\">13</a>; prob. also <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 37:7\" href=\"/Ezekiel.37.7\">37:7</a> (𝔊 Thes Co Krae; > <em>rustling, rattling</em>, Hi-Sm Toy); hence hyperbol. of shaking of earth by tramping of warriors <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 9:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.9.4\">Is 9:4</a>, by war-chariots <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 47:3\" href=\"/Jeremiah.47.3\">Je 47:3</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 10:22\" href=\"/Jeremiah.10.22\">10:22</a>, or wheels <a data-ref=\"Nahum 3:2\" href=\"/Nahum.3.2\">Na 3:2</a>, by war-horse(ʾs hoofs) <a data-ref=\"Job 39:24\" href=\"/Job.39.24\">Jb 39:24</a>. *(<span dir=\"rtl\">רֹנֶז</span>+)<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>quaking, trembling</em>, of pers. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 12:18\" href=\"/Ezekiel.12.18\">Ez 12:18</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  <em>shaking, quivering</em>, of dart <a data-ref=\"Job 41:21\" href=\"/Job.41.21\">Jb 41:21</a> (al. <em>rushing sound</em>).","next":"BDB, רָפָא","prev":"BDB, רָעַשׁ"}